{% comment %}
  OB: bestseller badge.

  Driven by a product metafield rather than by tags — Akeneo owns the tag
  namespace, so merchandising flags set in Shopify would be overwritten on the
  next sync. Both PDP placements read this one snippet so they cannot disagree
  about whether a product is a bestseller.

  Fails open: an unset field, or no field definition at all, renders nothing —
  no element, so no reserved gap in the flex rows that host it.

  Shop-side dependency: the `custom.bestseller` boolean metafield definition
  (see MIGRATION-TO-LIVE.md).

  Accepts:
  - product: {Object} product object
  - placement: {String} 'gallery' | 'price'

  Usage:
  {% render 'ob-product-badge', product: product, placement: 'price' %}
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign ob_is_bestseller = product.metafields.custom.bestseller.value
-%}

{%- if ob_is_bestseller -%}
  <span class="ob-badge ob-badge--{{ placement | default: 'price' }}">
    {{- 'products.product.bestseller' | t -}}
  </span>
{%- endif -%}
